is crate filled with issues.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-07\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"High Flying Artifacts\",\"overview\":\"There's turbulence in the air when Doug attempts to haul a retired airplane fuselage with his truck, as Dwight and Tyesha double book a load of ancient artifacts and a real embalming table in Austin, Texas.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-07\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"T-Wrecks\",\"overview\":\"As Dwight and Tyesha tangle with an animatronic T-Rex and chop it down to size, Doug bites off more than he can chew when moving a massive backyard Pirate Ship playhouse.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-14\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Bowling for Candy\",\"overview\":\"Molly and Russel get boxed in by the seller of a rare arcade bowling game with his shipping demands, while Tamara's haul of movie statues to Minnesota's largest candy store heats up with a large, flame-throwing side load.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-14\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Golf Claps & Bumper Car Scraps\",\"overview\":\"Natasha is amused by her classic bumper car haul but will the ride stay intact on her rig? Meanwhile, Tamara's mini-golf run turns south quickly when the 12 piece pick up turns into a 100 item load.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-21\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Ghosts & Floats\",\"overview\":\"Molly and Russell discover that the magic of movies is just an illusion when they attempt to haul an iconic picture car for a film premiere. Doug learns that a waterpark's lazy river is a bit of a misnomer especially when it comes to moving one.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-12-21\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Here's the Throne, Here's the Steeple\",\"overview\":\"A giant church steeple makes Natasha question her faith in a forklift, when she's the lone soul to complete the task of loading it. And winter comes for Dwight and Tyesha with a royal run comprising of a handcrafted throne and a giant king cake.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-04\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Glamping on a Gondola\",\"overview\":\"A load of vintage ski gondolas take Molly and Russell from the mountains of Vermont to the Colorado Rockies on a run that is somehow, only an uphill climb. While Doug is tasked with delivering a unique cabin to the one of the iconic Jellystone Parks.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-04\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Keep Calm and Carry Salon\",\"overview\":\"Natasha heads to the high desert for a showdown when she spearheads the transport of a roller derby track. Meanwhile, Molly and Russ have an unrelaxing spa day, moving the contents of a salon across a small Florida town.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-11\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Fowl Play\",\"overview\":\"While hauling a flock of live ducks and chickens to a new home, Dwight and Tyesha learn why farm animals don't always make good road companions. And although Tamara's feathered friends are actually swan shaped paddle boats, she too faces an unruly load.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-11\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Camel Clutch\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-18\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Gaming The Ninja\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-18\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Racing for Neon\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-25\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Land, Sea and th